{"id":"sabor","lemma":"sabor","pos":"noun","rank":1971,"glosses":["flavor; taste","seasoning"],"ipa":"/saˈboɾ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"sabores"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-sabor.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Notas el sabor del jengibre?","en":"Can you taste the ginger?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/915866"},{"text":"Amo el sabor del café.","en":"I love the smell of coffee.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586198"},{"text":"La leche tiene un sabor agrio.","en":"The milk tastes sour.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453101"},{"text":"Este medicamento tiene un sabor amargo.","en":"This medicine tastes bitter.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/330656"},{"text":"Este café tiene un sabor amargo.","en":"This coffee has a bitter taste.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/568500"}]}